cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "unitsleuth: detect mixed measurement units in unlabeled numeric columns"
type: software
version: 0.1.2
date-released: 2026-11-14
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/omarfaruqe/unitsleuth"
abstract: >-
  A Python package that detects mixed measurement units in numeric columns from
  the numbers alone, using a mixture-model approach after Di Zio, Guarnera and
  Luzi (2005), extended with affine conversions, row-consistent detection and repair.
keywords: [data-quality, units, measurement, mixture-model, data-cleaning]
authors:
  - family-names: Faruqe
    given-names: Md Omar
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1226-7226"
    affiliation: "University of Rajshahi"
